  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Compared with the initial release, this revision adds Microsoft and Apple federated credential validation, tenant-aware federated identity handling, and expanded multi-tenant authentication behavior. It adds Entity Framework Core migration support for PostgreSQL, SQL Server, and MySQL, including the Auth database schema, and standardizes design-time database configuration through the canonical KUKULCAN database provider and connection-string environment settings. Authentication contracts and persistence behavior have also been improved with tenant membership retrieval and normalized email handling.",
